WEBVTT

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.240
who travel the world,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at 
the top of this world

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.310
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.980
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.700
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.070
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.820
With you guys

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.790
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.770
If we join forces

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.530
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.850
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:23.460
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:29.100
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.070
We can’t lose!! We 
can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:37.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:42.450
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.050
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.960
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.030
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.280
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.440
The Cooking Fest's second round!

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.510
Komatsu had a showdown with 
the Oil Artisan, Wabutora,

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:15.210
with Death in the Balance Cooking.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.580
He had a brilliant victory 
against Wabutora.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.820
Komatsu advanced to the third round.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:24.690
Everyone is really fired up here!

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:29.090
This is Munage and the second round

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.510
of the Cooking Fest is over!

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:35.090
With the living Gourmet 
National Treasures, Setsuno

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.720
and the Cooking King, Zaus,

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.260
at the head of the list, 
there are 25 chefs left.

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:43.570
Now, the third round

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:48.210
will decide the 16 chefs who are 
going on to the final tournament!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.080
Somehow, he's won his way through.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.550
Get fired up, Komatsu!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:58.060
That's right! If I win here, I 
can be in the final tournament!

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.220
I have to focus!

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.030
Alright, the third round, which 
I'm sure you're curious about,

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.530
is Whole Island Cooking!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.000
Whole Island?!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Um... Like cooking things 
from all over an island?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.270
No, no, no, no. The island itself!

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:14.770
Excuse me?

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:20.380
I'm saying you'll be 
cooking an entire island!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.860
Do you understand?

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:26.220
An entire island?!

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:32.880
Who are the Strongest Partners? 
Whole Island Cooking!

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:37.560
Check it out!

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.960
All of these islands look like 
a heaping helping of delicious!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:46.170
Each chef will choose 
one of these islands

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:48.570
and then cook the whole thing!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.620
But there's no need 
to worry even one gram

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:53.840
about cooking an island.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.840
This area is blessed 
with a perfect climate,

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.820
so the vegetation grows back fast.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:02.440
The heaping helping of island 
environment totally recovers!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.590
Look at that!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.540
That island has dinosaur-like 
Beasts here and there!

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.900
This island has a heaping 
helping of giant insect Beasts!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.100
They're huge!

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:18.600
No! I don't wanna!

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:22.410
This competition will of 
course test cooking skill,

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.310
but also Gourmet Luck!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:26.750
Chefs who choose islands that have

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.910
an abundance of delicious ingredients

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.320
will have a winning advantage!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.880
They'll be able to make great food!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.110
Anyway, I'll pick an island 
that's safe and sound.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.220
Alright, chefs,

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.580
choose a partner to 
go to an island with.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.360
Really?!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:46.160
We don't have to go by ourselves?

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:51.500
Yes! Testing of your Gourmet Luck 
begins with choosing a partner.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.930
The better the partner,

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.940
the easier it'll be to get 
ingredients from the island.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:57.680
Alright?!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.110
Komatsu, leave it to me!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.780
Toriko-san! Of course!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.150
I'll leave the whole thing to you!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.890
No, no, no. You can't 
leave him the <i>whole</i> thing.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:11.660
Alright, everyone, get 
pumped and let's go!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:16.260
Okay, the chefs with their partners

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:19.330
Maiden Island

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:18.330
are off to the islands!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.350
National Treasure Setsuno and

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:23.870
her assistant, Nono, have 
chosen Maiden Island!

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:26.830
All of the ingredients are cute!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.340
Perfect for a maiden like me!

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:31.710
Maybe she means "old maid"?!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.940
Sensei, here come the ingredients.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.280
Oh! The masters of this island,

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:41.420
Cutiesauruses, have appeared already!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.950
Oh my!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:50.660
She knocked them for a loop 
with sweet words and cunning!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.120
Of course, one of the Four Kings and

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.300
his chef partner are also on the way!

00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.100
There are many, many 
gourmet ingredients here,

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.470
which is why this one's 
called Gourmet Island!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:05.290
Heading for it are Hotel 
Gourmet's Chef Komatsu

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:06.980
and Toriko of the Four Kings!

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.820
Hundreds of varieties 
of fruit grow on it!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.520
Fruit Paradise Tree!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.620
There's a Marbled Beef 
Boulder over here!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.090
There are lemons that 
smell like almonds...

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:20.160
Lemonds!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.060
Chrysanthemums with 
yakiniku flower petals!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.330
Yakinichrysanthemums!

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.640
All of the gourmet ingredients 
here look delicious!

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:31.570
I wonder why anyone else 
didn't choose this island...

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.030
No one else even headed for it.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.940
Who knows?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.680
D-Don't!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:42.450
I have to cook the entire island!

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:45.350
If we eat any of the island's 
ingredients, we're out.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.520
What?!

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.090
That's an inhumane rule!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.190
Can I have...

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:52.390
...just one petal?

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:53.730
No.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.860
I have a feeling there's 
a huge catch to this...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.840
The flower...

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.070
Poison Island is overflowing 
with poisonous ingredients,

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.840
perfect for Poison Cuisine Chef 
Tylan and Coco of the Four Kings.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:15.580
Is this the beginning of a great 
partnership built on poison?!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:18.880
I want Komatsu-kun to win,

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.350
but since Chef Tylan asked 
me, I'll do my best.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.360
As a Gourmet Hunter!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:35.170
A mushroom with just the 
right amount of poison.

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.900
Just as every beautiful rose has thorns,

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.610
delicious food has poison.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.580
Actually, the majority doesn't.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.710
Munage-san! Munage-san!

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:52.220
I'm at Gigan Island, an island 
that's as big as a continent!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.620
Look at this!

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.160
Brunch the tengu

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.020
and Zebra of the Four 
Kings are partners!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.460
Surprise!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.960
That's a rare combination!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.030
Listen, I ain't helpin' you out.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.340
I just came along 'cause I'm hungry.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.870
Yeah, I know, I know.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.940
Well, let's capture somethin'.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.810
Like I'm gonna let you eat... 
I'll be disqualified.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.110
I partnered up with you 
so I could kick your ass!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:23.080
I'll win the competition

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.920
and drag your unconscious 
smart-ass around.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.620
It'll be killing two 
birds with one stone!

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:31.240
I can hear you, tengu bastard!

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:33.730
Oh yeah?

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:35.630
I didn't know you had such sharp ears.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.360
Get cocky with me...

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:41.170
I'll kick your ass before I eat!

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:44.490
Go for it!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.540
That's it for me on Gigan Island!

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:54.510
Tina-chin, thank you and good luck!

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.450
Medicinal Island, which is 
full of traditional medicine.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:03.480
Meal King Yuda and Sunny of the 
Four Kings were heading there...

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.460
All of these medicinal ingredients 
seem like they'd be good for beauty!

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.700
Especially this ginseng...

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.430
I think I got all of the ingredients,

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:17.640
without letting even one 
millimeter get away.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:23.470
Yuda and Sunny have quickly 
captured everything on the island!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.350
What's this?

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:28.680
Chef Zaus hasn't decided 
on his island yet.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.950
I figured out the trick 
to walking on water!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:37.760
And Chef Zaus has partnered 
with a strange Gourmet Hunter!

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.090
Choosin' me shows you got promise!

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.360
I'll just say it.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.030
You're gonna win this thing!

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.990
I would win with or without you.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:52.200
I chose you because you 
happened to be standing there.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:57.180
In the first place, I 
don't need a partner.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.680
Hey, old man.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:02.540
You should know better than to 
pretend to be tough at your age!

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.790
Oh my! The island moved!

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.360
I drank it! I drank a lot!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.140
Oh my god!

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.870
It's a squid!

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:27.910
Squid Island

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.940
It's a squid, not an island! 
It's an island impostor!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.780
What kind of island attacks you?! Huh?!

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.880
This saves me some time in capturing it.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.400
Ouch!

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:50.400
What did you do?!

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.960
Knocking.

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:56.530
Let's see. Maybe I'll grill it as is.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.800
Chef Zaus has also gotten his island!

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:05.480
We've gotten a ton of ingredients.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.810
Even though we've just picked them,

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.820
the flowers are already blooming?!

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:16.690
I see. That's why it's 
called a Gourmet Island.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.820
No matter how much you take, 
it regenerates right away.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:22.190
T-There's no end.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:24.600
At this rate, I'll never be able to

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:29.000
cook the whole island!

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:44.980
Most of the chefs have finished 
cooking their whole island,

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:46.430
so now it's time to judge.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:51.570
Poison scorpion roasted whole...

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:54.490
It's a Special Preparation 
Ingredient because

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.130
it's tough to get the poison out.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:59.530
A dish that only Chef Tylan could make.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.900
Because of its poison, it 
has no natural predators.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.980
So it has time to mature 
and become delicious.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:08.970
It certainly does have a fine flavor.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.110
The judge is moving on,

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:16.580
but Chefs Komatsu and 
Brunch have yet to return!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.950
M-Munage-san!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.450
About the Chef Brunch 
and Zebra partnership...

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:24.620
I'll take you and your 
banana nose down a notch!

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:27.330
Oh, quit your yappin' already!

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:31.200
They're still quarreling,

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.270
but the Beasts on the island have 
gotten swept up in their fight

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.200
and are all knocked out!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:38.800
Is that right?!

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:42.770
Um, all of the other chefs are 
have already started cooking...

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:46.110
Then I better get cookin' too!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.280
You're gonna run off in the 
middle of a fight?! Hey!

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:50.580
And gimme them things!

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:53.220
Like I'd let you eat 'em, dumbass!

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:01.330
And so, the only team that 
hasn't finished capturing

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:04.060
is Chef Komatsu and his partner!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.440
We keep picking and picking, 
but we're not done.

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:14.010
This is my first experience 
getting stumped

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.740
by capturing delicious food.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:20.910
Everyone else has started cooking.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.050
There's no way I can finish in time.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.450
Toriko-san...

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:28.850
Shall we eat this?

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:30.190
Are you sure?

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:34.530
Yes. A guy like me even 
making it to the third round

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:36.430
is good enough.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.300
I'm satisfied.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.530
Komatsu...

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.300
Let's eat, Toriko-san!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.110
Looking at that frustrated face

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.240
pretty much takes away my appetite...

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:50.440
Don't worry about me!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.880
Let's have some delicious food

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.550
while looking at the beautiful scenery!

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:59.250
The sea is especially 
beautiful, isn't it?!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.520
So sparkling!!

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:06.620
Unlike me, who didn't 
shine at the Fest...

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:10.460
It's a sign that it's 
packed with nutrition.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:15.280
The sea is full of nature 
because of the islands.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.370
Fallen leaves and plants from 
mountains and forests...

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:23.200
And when the animals return to 
dust, it becomes fertile ground.

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:26.610
That's because it becomes nutritious 
from the nitrogen and minerals.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.810
Rainwater comes from 
that fertile ground,

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:31.450
taking in plenty of its nutrition.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:32.580
It flows through the rivers,

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:35.490
which then connects back to the sea.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.820
I see...

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:42.640
The nutrition from the islands 
permeates everything, huh?

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:44.030
The whole shebang...

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.160
Yeah.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.070
Everything is packed with it.

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:52.000
Everything?!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.510
This sea...

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.730
It contains the nutrients 
from the entire island.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.580
It has a delicious flavor.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:09.020
It's impossible to cook the sea,

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:13.490
but there is an ingredient that's lived 
its life steeped in its nutrients.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:15.530
Yes. That's...

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.260
...oysters!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.400
It's said that for raising oysters,

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.650
instead of the sea, it's better to get

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.230
the oysters from a river or

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.670
mountainous environment 
where the sea runs through!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:29.440
There are tons of 'em in 
that forest and mountain!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:35.310
And the milky scent of the oysters 
from the sea is hangin' in the air!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.850
Well, I'll capture a few!

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.190
Toriko-san!

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:44.290
Please get the choicest ones!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.060
Count on it!

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:50.460
Oysters that are full of the 
whole island's nutrients...

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.840
A delicate taste containing 
the deliciousness

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.390
of the entire island condensed!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.970
It'll work! This'll work!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.170
That was fast! You already caught them?!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.980
No, not yet!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:05.810
What?!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.240
W-What is that?!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.350
T-That's a big oyster!

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:15.540
It's like an island itself!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.260
That oyster

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:22.660
is so huge, it's called an island!

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:26.660
Oyster Isle

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:26.220
Oyster Isle, to be precise!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.280
What an abundance of nutrients!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.440
It sure is a Gourmet Island!

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.770
But it's too big!

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.580
Get back, Komatsu.

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.710
Flying Fork!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.950
It's tough...

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.320
It ain't gonna let itself 
be eaten that easily, huh?

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:48.120
Remember, you can't eat it!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:59.000
Uh-oh! Oyster attack!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.930
It's going to crash into 
the Gourmet Island!

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:03.800
Watch out! Here it comes!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:07.710
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.680
Time to eat!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:15.510
Ten-fold Spiked Punch!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.920
Thank you for the meal.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:32.230
Gourmet Hunter Toriko did it!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.000
He knocked out Oyster Isle!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.790
What exquisite meat!

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:47.780
It looks delicious!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.710
But you still can't eat it!

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:58.490
Tasty indeed. What is this flavor?

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.290
Squeezing Lemond from 
the Gourmet Island on it

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.490
makes it tasty too!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.530
That makes it more refreshing 
and increases the flavor!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.470
I've also prepared fried oysters!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.810
Oyster that's absorbed the essence 
of an entire Gourmet Island...

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.280
That's why it's called Oyster Isle.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.990
It's like capturing two 
islands for the price of one!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:25.650
Um, Toriko-san, don't 
eat too much of it!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.150
What's the difference?

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.850
You're done cooking. Let me eat!

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.860
But I want everyone 
to be able to share...

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:35.390
No doubt about it, he'll make the cut.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.830
Me too, of course.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:40.830
This Giga Meat from Gigan Island 
will definitely see me through.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:44.200
Listen, you only captured 
that 'cause of me!

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:47.070
So I'm gonna eat it!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:48.310
What are you, stupid?

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.840
If you ate it, they wouldn't 
be able to judge it!

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:53.140
Chef Brunch! If you're 
ready for the judging?

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:54.450
Alright!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.650
Wait up, jackass!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:59.820
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:04.420
The chefs who are going on

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.610
to the 50th Cooking Fest final 
tournament are all present!

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:09.960
The 16 finalists...

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:12.400
...are right here!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.870
I made it!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.700
So, in the final tournament, we have...

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:22.420
Komatsu versus Zaus!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.680
Kopuriko versus Dhamala Sky the 13th!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.450
Hollis versus Lulubu!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.120
Mama Tsurara versus Makube!

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.250
Chiru versus Yuda!

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.190
Brunch versus Livebearer!

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.890
Apollo versus Tylan!

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:42.730
Darin versus Setsuno!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.270
I-I'm suddenly competing 
against Chef Zaus?!

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:54.220
You're a good match for each other!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.990
Sounds like somethin's here...

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:10.840
At last...

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:41.020
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:47.760
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:53.230
Only a smile has no flavor, so wipe your tears

00:20:53.230 --> 00:21:00.040
After a downpour of rain from the sky, the sun always rises high

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:05.510
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:11.120
My heart races and I become captivated

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.900
Don’t give up!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:20.180
I’m closest to you in 
the middle of a challenge

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:24.700
Always believe in yourself!

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:37.540
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:37.410
Guess the Legend! The 
Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.650
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.990
In this segment, you guess 
the legendary ingredients

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:44.670
of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.390
Really?! Level 2

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.390
Today's "Really?!" level is 2.

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:55.160
Heavenly voice! Please 
help me today too!

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:58.360
Someone once said...

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:02.860
If you split open this fruit, there 
are delicious seeds of sushi inside.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.780
Something something!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:09.490
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:11.180
Start!

00:22:11.740 --> 00:22:13.950
Fruit with sushi inside?

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.650
It's possible, isn't it?

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:17.520
After all, this is the Gourmet Age.

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:21.290
Your hint is what kind of fruit is this?

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:24.560
Someone once said...

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:30.990
Coconut Sushi

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:27.860
If you split open this fruit, there 
are delicious seeds of sushi inside.

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.000
Coconut Sushi!

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:34.230
Coconut with sushi inside!

00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:36.330
Just Coconut Sushi, huh?

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:39.440
Rumor has it some don't have wasabi and 
it can come in chirashizushi style...

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:41.840
But those are just rumors.

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:44.010
And now, our next segment!
